  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project payment to St Helena&apos;s development agency (Enterprise St Helena)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Project payment to St Helena&apos;s development agency (Enterprise St Helena) is a component of Support to Enterprise St Helena 2013/14 to 2016/17 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;4,017,355. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Trade policy and administrative management, Tourism policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
